      "id": "claim_58788c62c621443181a84c2653e5eb2d",
      "statement": "A DelegatedGrantsUpdated activity is handled by one per-peer consumer (processDelegatedGrantsUpdated, workflow id delegated-grants:<webId>:<peerId>) that replicates the mirror through a syncReciprocalMirror child workflow on the reciprocal-registration queue, then regenerates the delegated grants, then completes the drained activities, so a completion implies the mirror was refreshed in that same drain; reconcileActivities reuses the same consumer with the same deterministic workflow id.",
